  "id": "58b03580-d9bf-4a74-aeb8-07dd0754c005",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. A unified model for ECG-free dynamic coronary roadmapping using spatio-temporal transformers enables real-time guidance in PCI procedures, while another report highlights its application in ECG-free settings with pretraining and auxiliary tasks.",
